  'land.stat.players': 'real players', 'land.stat.clubs': 'clubs', 'land.stat.leagues': 'leagues', 'land.stat.moments': 'actions simulated per match',
  'land.featuresTitle': 'Everything you loved – and everything you always missed', 'land.featuresSub': 'The classic depth of 2001 with a modern engine, beautiful design and play on every screen.',
  'land.f.engine.title': 'A match engine that thinks', 'land.f.engine.text': '240 actions per match, xG, momentum and heatmaps. Tactics matter – and there are no exploit formations.',
  'land.f.players.title': '20,000+ real players', 'land.f.players.text': '38 leagues and 662 clubs worldwide – from the Danish Superliga to the Premier League and the Champions League.',
  'land.f.scouting.title': 'Scouting with uncertainty', 'land.f.scouting.text': 'Your scouts see ranges, not the truth. Good scouts find wonderkids before anyone else.',
  'land.f.press.title': 'Press conferences and talks', 'land.f.press.text': 'Answer the journalists, praise or hairdryer the dressing room – in your own words.',
  'land.f.transfers.title': 'A living transfer market', 'land.f.transfers.text': 'Bidding wars, clubs returning with bigger bids, loans with options to buy and pushy agents.',
  'land.f.ai.title': 'AI opponents with a will', 'land.f.ai.text': 'Managers who scout your tactics and react mid-match. Players with demands, cliques and moods.',
  'land.f.ranking.title': 'Global leaderboards', 'land.f.ranking.text': 'Every season earns points for the job done. Overachieve with a small club and climb past the big-club managers.',
  'land.f.online.title': 'Online with friends', 'land.f.online.text': 'Run your own clubs in the same world – bid for each other\'s players and meet in the league.',
  'land.f.mobile.title': 'Anywhere, even offline', 'land.f.mobile.text': 'Play on desktop, tablet or phone. Install it as an app and carry on where you left off.',
