  'land.s.matchday.b1': 'xG, shot maps, momentum and heatmaps', 'land.s.matchday.b2': 'Your assistant\'s analysis after every match', 'land.s.matchday.b3': 'Pause, change tactics and make subs with the keyboard',
  'land.s.tactics.kicker': 'Tactics', 'land.s.tactics.title': 'Your plan, your team', 'land.s.tactics.text': 'Drag players around the pitch, fine-tune instructions and build chemistry.',
  'land.s.tactics.b1': '12 formations and full team instructions', 'land.s.tactics.b2': 'Team chemistry: nationality, leaders and time together', 'land.s.tactics.b3': 'Opponents adapt to your line-up',
  'land.s.people.kicker': 'People', 'land.s.people.title': 'Players with personality', 'land.s.people.text': 'Ambitious stars, troublemakers and leaders. Talk to them – and to the press – and live with the consequences.',
  'land.s.people.b1': 'Detailed profiles with development charts', 'land.s.people.b2': 'Talks, fines and team meetings', 'land.s.people.b3': 'Press conferences before and after matches',
  'land.s.career.kicker': 'Career', 'land.s.career.title': 'Write your own story', 'land.s.career.text': 'Promotion and relegation, cup finals, Europe and awards nights. Get sacked, apply for jobs, become a legend.',
  'land.s.career.b1': 'Real league systems with play-offs and splits', 'land.s.career.b2': 'Fans, board and finances that react', 'land.s.career.b3': 'Youth prospects and players retiring',
  'land.rankKicker': 'Competition', 'land.rankTitle': 'Are you the best manager around?', 'land.rankText': 'Manager Score rewards the job, not just the budget: finish against expectation, league strength, titles, Europe, finances and young players. Only the first attempt at each season counts.',
  'land.rankCta': 'Start your career', 'land.rankBoard': 'Leaderboard – career total', 'land.rankEmpty': 'The leaderboard is brand new. Finish your first season and take first place.',
  'land.stepsTitle': 'From kick-off to champions in three clicks',
  'land.step1.title': 'Choose your club', 'land.step1.text': 'Take over a giant – or take on the challenge with a small second-tier club.',
  'land.step2.title': 'Build your team', 'land.step2.text': 'Scout, negotiate, train and find the tactic that gets the most from your squad.',
  'land.step3.title': 'Climb the leaderboard', 'land.step3.text': 'Every season earns points. Share your position and challenge your friends.',
  'land.faqTitle': 'Frequently asked questions',
  'land.q1': 'Does it cost anything?', 'land.a1': 'No. The game is free, with no ads or in-game purchases.',
  'land.q2': 'Do I need to install anything?', 'land.a2': 'No, it runs in your browser. You can install it as an app on phone and desktop, and it works offline too.',
  'land.q3': 'Where is my game saved?', 'land.a3': 'Locally on your device – automatically, so you can close the tab and continue later. You can also export and import saves.',
  'land.q4': 'Are the players real?', 'land.a4': 'Yes, more than 20,000 real players from an open dataset (transfermarkt-datasets, CC0). Abilities are derived from market value and age.',
  'land.q5': 'Can I play with friends?', 'land.a5': 'Yes. Create an online game, share the code and run your own clubs in the same world.',
  'land.q6': 'Is this the original Championship Manager?', 'land.a6': 'No. It is an independent fan project, built from scratch and inspired by the 2001 classic.',
  'land.finalTitle': 'Your club is waiting.', 'land.finalText': 'The season starts when you press the button.',
  'land.footerData': 'Player data: transfermarkt-datasets (CC0)',
